<section_file chapter="ch07" chapter_number="7" section="sect_02" section_number="2">
  <section number="7.2" title="Integration Using Tables of Integrals">
    <subsection title="A Table of Integrals">
      <paragraph>
        We have studied several techniques for finding an antiderivative of a function. However, useful as they are, these techniques are not always applicable. There are numerous other methods for finding an antiderivative of a function. Extensive lists of integration formulas have been compiled based on these methods.
      </paragraph>
      <paragraph>
        A small sample of the integration formulas that can be found in many mathematical handbooks is given in the following table of integrals. The formulas are grouped according to the basic form of the integrand. Note that it may be necessary to modify the integrand of the integral to be evaluated in order to use one of these formulas.
      </paragraph>
      <table>
        <thead>
          <row>
            <cell header="true">TABLE OF INTEGRALS</cell>
          </row>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <row>
            <cell>
              <paragraph>
                <strong>Forms Involving a + bu</strong>
              </paragraph>
            </cell>
          </row>
          <row>
            <cell>
              <list ordered="false">
                <item>
                  <paragraph>
                    <math display="inline">$${\int\frac{udu}{a + bu}} = \frac{1}{b^{2}}‍\left( {a + bu - a\ln\left| {a + bu} \right|} \right) + C$$</math>
                  </paragraph>
                </item>
                <item>
                  <paragraph>
                    <math display="inline">$${\int\frac{u^{2}du}{a + bu}} = \frac{1}{2b^{3}}‍{\lbrack{\left( {a + bu} \right)^{2} - 4a\left( {a + bu} \right) + 2a^{2}\ln\left| {a + bu} \right|}\rbrack} + C$$</math>
                  </paragraph>
                </item>
                <item>
                  <paragraph>
                    <math display="inline">$${\int{\frac{udu}{\left( {a + bu} \right)^{2}} = \frac{1}{b^{2}}‍\left( {\frac{a}{a + bu} + \ln\left| {a + bu} \right|} \right)}} + C$$</math>
                  </paragraph>
                </item>
                <item>
                  <paragraph>
                    <math display="inline">$${\int{u\sqrt{a + bu}du}} = \frac{2}{15b^{2}}‍\left( {3bu - 2a} \right)\left( {a + bu} \right)^{3 \slash 2} + C$$</math>
                  </paragraph>
                </item>
                <item>
                  <paragraph>
                    <math display="inline">$$\int\frac{udu}{\sqrt{a + bu}} = \frac{2}{3b^{2}}‍\left( {bu - 2a} \right)\sqrt{a + bu} + C$$</math>
                  </paragraph>
                </item>
                <item>
                  <paragraph>
                    <math display="inline">$${{\int{\frac{\mathit{du}}{u\sqrt{a + bu}} = \frac{1}{\sqrt{a}}\ln\left| \frac{\sqrt{a + bu} - \sqrt{a}}{\sqrt{a + bu} + \sqrt{a}} \right|}} + C}\qquad\left( {{if}a &gt; 0} \right)$$</math>
                  </paragraph>
                </item>
              </list>
            </cell>
          </row>
          <row>
            <cell>
              <paragraph>
                <strong>Forms Involving a 2 + u 2 , a &gt; 0</strong>
              </paragraph>
            </cell>
          </row>
          <row>
            <cell>
              <list ordered="false">
                <item>
                  <paragraph>
                    <math display="inline">$${\int\sqrt{a^{2} + u^{2}}}du = \frac{u}{2}\sqrt{a^{2} + u^{2}} + \frac{a^{2}}{2}\ln\left| {u + \sqrt{a^{2} + u^{2}}} \right| + C$$</math>
                  </paragraph>
                </item>
                <item>
                  <paragraph>
                    <math display="inline">$${\int{u^{2}\sqrt{a^{2} + u^{2}}du = \frac{u}{8}\left( {a^{2} + 2u^{2}} \right)\sqrt{a^{2} + u^{2}} - \frac{a^{4}}{8}\ln\left| {u + \sqrt{a^{2} + u^{2}}} \right|}} + C$$</math>
                  </paragraph>
                </item>
                <item>
                  <paragraph>
                    <math display="inline">$${\int{\frac{\mathit{du}}{\sqrt{a^{2} + u^{2}}} = \ln\left| {u + \sqrt{a^{2} + u^{2}}} \right|}} + C$$</math>
                  </paragraph>
                </item>
                <item>
                  <paragraph>
                    <math display="inline">$${\int\frac{\mathit{du}}{u\sqrt{a^{2} + u^{2}}}} = - ‍\frac{1}{a}‍\ln\left| \frac{\sqrt{a^{2} + u^{2}} + a}{u} \right| + C$$</math>
                  </paragraph>
                </item>
                <item>
                  <paragraph>
                    <math display="inline">$${\int\frac{\mathit{du}}{u^{2}\sqrt{a^{2} + u^{2}}}} = - ‍\frac{\sqrt{a^{2} + u^{2}}}{a^{2}u} + C$$</math>
                  </paragraph>
                </item>
                <item>
                  <paragraph>
                    <math display="inline">$$\int{\frac{\mathit{du}}{\left( {a^{2} + u^{2}} \right)^{3 \slash 2}} = \frac{u}{a^{2}\sqrt{a^{2} + u^{2}}} + C}$$</math>
                  </paragraph>
                </item>
              </list>
            </cell>
          </row>
          <row>
            <cell>
              <paragraph>
                <strong>Forms Involving u 2 - a 2 , a &gt; 0</strong>
              </paragraph>
            </cell>
          </row>
          <row>
            <cell>
              <list ordered="false">
                <item>
                  <paragraph>
                    <math display="inline">$$\int\sqrt{u^{2} - a^{2}}du = \frac{u}{2}\sqrt{u^{2} - a^{2}} - \frac{a^{2}}{2}\ln\left| {u + \sqrt{u^{2} - a^{2}}} \right| + C$$</math>
                  </paragraph>
                </item>
                <item>
                  <paragraph>
                    <math display="inline">$${\int u^{2}}\sqrt{u^{2} - a^{2}}du = \frac{u}{8}\left( {2u^{2} - a^{2}} \right)\sqrt{u^{2} - a^{2}} - \frac{a^{4}}{8}\ln\left| {u + \sqrt{u^{2} - a^{2}}} \right| + C$$</math>
                  </paragraph>
                </item>
                <item>
                  <paragraph>
                    <math display="inline">$${\int{\frac{\sqrt{u^{2} - a^{2}}}{u^{2}}}}du = - ‍\frac{\sqrt{u^{2} - a^{2}}}{u} + \ln\left| {u + \sqrt{u^{2} - a^{2}}} \right| + C$$</math>
                  </paragraph>
                </item>
                <item>
                  <paragraph>
                    <math display="inline">$${\int{\frac{\mathit{du}}{\sqrt{u^{2} - a^{2}}} = \ln\left| {u + \sqrt{u^{2} - a^{2}}} \right|}} + C$$</math>
                  </paragraph>
                </item>
                <item>
                  <paragraph>
                    <math display="inline">$${\int\frac{\mathit{du}}{u^{2}\sqrt{u^{2} - a^{2}}}} = \frac{\sqrt{u^{2} - a^{2}}}{a^{2}u} + C$$</math>
                  </paragraph>
                </item>
                <item>
                  <paragraph>
                    <math display="inline">$${\int\frac{\mathit{du}}{\left( {u^{2} - a^{2}} \right)^{3 \slash 2}}} = - ‍\frac{u}{a^{2}\sqrt{u^{2} - a^{2}}} + C$$</math>
                  </paragraph>
                </item>
              </list>
            </cell>
          </row>
          <row>
            <cell>
              <paragraph>
                <strong>Forms Involving a 2 - u 2 , a &gt; 0</strong>
              </paragraph>
            </cell>
          </row>
          <row>
            <cell>
              <list ordered="false">
                <item>
                  <paragraph>
                    <math display="inline">$${\int\frac{\sqrt{a^{2} - u^{2}}}{u}}du = \sqrt{a^{2} - u^{2}} - a\ln\left| \frac{a + \sqrt{a^{2} - u^{2}}}{u} \right| + C$$</math>
                  </paragraph>
                </item>
                <item>
                  <paragraph>
                    <math display="inline">$${\int\frac{\mathit{du}}{u\sqrt{a^{2} - u^{2}}}} = - ‍\frac{1}{a}\ln\left| \frac{a + \sqrt{a^{2} - u^{2}}}{u} \right| + C$$</math>
                  </paragraph>
                </item>
                <item>
                  <paragraph>
                    <math display="inline">$${\int\frac{\mathit{du}}{u^{2}\sqrt{a^{2} - u^{2}}}} = - ‍\frac{\sqrt{a^{2} - u^{2}}}{a^{2}u} + C$$</math>
                  </paragraph>
                </item>
                <item>
                  <paragraph>
                    <math display="inline">$${\int\frac{\mathit{du}}{\left( {a^{2} - u^{2}} \right)^{3 \slash 2}}} = \frac{u}{a^{2}\sqrt{a^{2} - u^{2}}} + C$$</math>
                  </paragraph>
                </item>
              </list>
            </cell>
          </row>
          <row>
            <cell>
              <paragraph>
                <strong>Forms Involving e au and ln u</strong>
              </paragraph>
            </cell>
          </row>
          <row>
            <cell>
              <list ordered="false">
                <item>
                  <paragraph>
                    <math display="inline">$$\int{ue^{\mathit{au}}du = \frac{1}{a^{2}}\left( {au - 1} \right)e^{\mathit{au}} + C}$$</math>
                  </paragraph>
                </item>
                <item>
                  <paragraph>
                    <math display="inline">$$\int{u^{n}‍e^{\mathit{au}}du = \frac{1}{a}u^{n}‍e^{\mathit{au}} - \frac{n}{a}{\int{u^{n - 1}‍e^{\mathit{au}}du}}}$$</math>
                  </paragraph>
                </item>
                <item>
                  <paragraph>
                    <math display="inline">$$\int{\frac{\mathit{du}}{1 + be^{\mathit{au}}} = u - \frac{1}{a}\ln\left( {1 + be^{\mathit{au}}} \right) + C}$$</math>
                  </paragraph>
                </item>
                <item>
                  <paragraph>
                    <math display="inline">$${\int{\ln udu}} = u\ln u - u + C$$</math>
                  </paragraph>
                </item>
                <item>
                  <paragraph>
                    <math display="inline">$${{\int{u^{n}\ln udu}} = \frac{u^{n + 1}}{\left( {n + 1} \right)^{2}}{\lbrack\left( {n + 1} \right)‍\ln u - 1\rbrack} + C}\qquad\left( {n \neq - 1} \right)$$</math>
                  </paragraph>
                </item>
                <item>
                  <paragraph>
                    <math display="inline">$$\int{\frac{\mathit{du}}{u\ln u} = \ln\left| {\ln u} \right| + C}$$</math>
                  </paragraph>
                </item>
                <item>
                  <paragraph>
                    <math display="inline">$$\int{\left( {\ln u} \right)^{n}du = u\left( {\ln u} \right)^{n} - n{\int{\left( {\ln u} \right)^{n - 1}du}}}$$</math>
                  </paragraph>
                </item>
              </list>
            </cell>
          </row>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </subsection>
  </section>
